{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Reference for the best-effort building (prompts/DXF2BIM_MODELLER_LANE.md \u00a7L13). Data only. Each IFC class has ONE part entry: the material, and the quantity FORMULA over named measures of the body's mesh. Rates are never stated here: rate_ref names the class in the rate pack (viewer/rates/<pack>.json materials[class]); a class with no pack rate costs 0 and is listed.",
  "measures": {
    "V": "volume of the mesh, m3",
    "A": "area of the largest pair of parallel faces, m2 (the plate, wall or slab face; exact for prisms)",
    "t": "V / A, m (thickness of a plate-like body)",
    "L": "longest bounding-box dimension, m",
    "N": "1 (one body)"
  },
  "material_colour": {
    "about": "DISPLAY convention (prompts/DXF2BIM_MODELLER_LANE.md section L26): the standard colour each material is shown in, [r,g,b] 0..1. Not a measurement. A material with no entry is shown neutral grey and listed as no_colour.",
